[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3 uid="uid://wardbfixkeypad001"]

; Wall-mounted staff-access keypad. Canonical size 0.40W x 0.50H x 0.14D,
; origin at the centre of the volume, faceplate faces -Z. Composite so it
; reads as a fixture rather than a flat wall panel (see godot/MIGRATION_NOTES.md
; and src/game/world.ts:789 for the three.js original this ports): cool
; slate-blue body (a different hue family from the dispenser's warm
; gray-green), a recessed near-black backing panel, a 3x4 grid of individual
; raised keys, a small cyan-glow display strip, and an "STAFF ACCESS" plate.
; Smaller footprint and a distinctly different silhouette (many small bumps
; vs the dispenser's single slot+tray) so the two are never confused at a
; glance.
;
; Visuals only — no collision, no gameplay script. The room generator supplies
; the Area3D + CollisionShape3D this gets instanced under.

